==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} print of this card was available as part of the [[Mission (TCG Pocket)#Eevee Mass Outbreak Event Missions| Eevee Mass Outbreak Event]] missions, which ran from July 21 to 30, 2025, and was awarded to players who collected 3 Eevee cards during the mission period.

